EDuke32

W, S  forwards, backwards
Cursor left, right  turn
A, D  side-step
Mouse  look and turn, left button  fire
Right Ctrl  fire
E  open doors, press switches
Space  jump, Left Ctrl  crouch
Left Shift  run
1 to 0  weapons
Return  use the item, [ and ]  choose it
Tab  map
Esc  menu (Options changes the keys)
F1 help, F2 save, F3 load, F6 quick save, F9 quick load
